# Spin-flip TDDFT / 6-31G* / BHHLYP on H2O.
# A high-spin (triplet) ROHF reference is spin-flipped down to reach the
# singlet manifold; the sf model implies that reference.  SF roots are not
# spin-adapted before diagonalization, so the target is given as root=N.
sf(nstate=3)/bhhlyp/6-31g* grad(root=3)
geom="""
O   0.000000000   0.000000000  -0.041061554
H  -0.533194329   0.533194329  -0.614469223
H   0.533194329  -0.533194329  -0.614469223
"""
